<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST140"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ryan_olesin<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ryan_olesin<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 30, 2004 - 2:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I put a site up about the Alphabet Killer. There&#39;s not much there but then again there&#39;s not much out there on it. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.olesin.50megs.com/alphabetkiller" target=_top>http://www.olesin.50megs.com/alphabetkiller</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
