<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST141"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 30, 2004 - 3:36 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Interesting Ryan, This killer must find a town first,then looks for a victim who has the same first letter in their name? I will be checking your site for up dates. Will you have links to your Zodiac site? I have many people in Kansas, asking to see the picture of the suspect Kane you have.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
