<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST708"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, August 08, 2004 - 9:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.preciousdoe.com/" target=_top>http://www.preciousdoe.com/</a> <BR> <BR>The Case of &#34; Precious Doe&#34; Kansas city MS. <BR><a href="http://abcnews.go.com/sections/us/DailyNews/precious_doe010614.html" target=_top>http://abcnews.go.com/sections/us/DailyNews/precio us_doe010614.html</a> <BR> <BR>I&#39;m actually working on publicity for the case of &#34;Precious Doe&#34; out of Kansas City. Mr. Washington is a comic book artist, as well as community activist in the african american community. Please take a look at &#34;Precious Doe&#34; and his site and see if you can help solve a mystery.The second link has other cases deserving of attention as well.  <BR><a href="http://www.omega7.com/" target=_top>http://www.omega7.com/</a> <BR><a href="http://www.omega7.com/html/MissingKids.html" target=_top>http://www.omega7.com/html/MissingKids.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
